sequenceDiagram
    participant Engine as llm-d Inference Engine
    participant TrainSvc as Training Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant PVC as PVC<br/>/models/*.joblib
    participant PredSvc as Prediction Server<br/>8001/TCP HTTP
    participant LocalFS as emptyDir<br/>/local_models/*.joblib
    participant Router as llm-d Routing Layer

    Note over Engine,TrainSvc: Flow 1: Training Data Ingestion

    Engine->>TrainSvc: POST /add_training_data_bulk<br/>TTFT/TPOT observations + features<br/>(kv_cache_pct, input_tokens, queue_depth,<br/>prefix_cache_score, tokens_in_flight)
    TrainSvc->>TrainSvc: Store in bucketed deques<br/>(5 queue x 20 cache x 4 prefix = 400 buckets)

    Note over TrainSvc,PVC: Flow 1: Periodic Retraining (30min default)

    TrainSvc->>TrainSvc: Check min_samples >= 1000
    TrainSvc->>TrainSvc: Train XGBoost/LightGBM/BayesianRidge<br/>Quantile (p90) or Mean regression
    alt Ensemble Mode Enabled
        TrainSvc->>TrainSvc: Split by queue regime<br/>(noqueue vs queued)
        TrainSvc->>TrainSvc: Train separate sub-models
    end
    TrainSvc->>PVC: Write *.joblib (serialized models)

    Note over PredSvc,TrainSvc: Flow 2: Model Sync (10s interval)

    loop Every MODEL_SYNC_INTERVAL_SEC
        PredSvc->>TrainSvc: GET /model/{name}/info<br/>Check timestamp/checksum
        alt Model changed (MD5 mismatch)
            PredSvc->>TrainSvc: GET /model/{name}/download<br/>Download joblib file
            PredSvc->>LocalFS: Atomic file replacement<br/>(write tmp + rename)
            PredSvc->>PredSvc: Reload model into memory
        end
    end

    Note over Router,PredSvc: Flow 2: Prediction Serving

    Router->>PredSvc: POST /predict<br/>{kv_cache_percentage, num_tokens_input,<br/>num_request_waiting, prefix_cache_score}
    PredSvc->>PredSvc: Feature extraction + model inference
    PredSvc-->>Router: {predicted_ttft, predicted_tpot}

    Router->>PredSvc: POST /predict/bulk/strict<br/>(up to 10,000 requests)
    PredSvc->>PredSvc: Batch inference via numpy/DataFrame
    PredSvc-->>Router: Array of predictions (ORJSONResponse)
